msgid "Local monitoring of the CrowdSec Firewall Bouncer. Shows the blocks currently applied in the OpenWrt nftables sets. The Bouncer synchronises decisions with the LAPI automatically; this dashboard is read-only."
msgstr "Monitoramento local do CrowdSec Firewall Bouncer. Mostra os bloqueios atualmente aplicados nos conjuntos nftables do OpenWrt. O Bouncer sincroniza as decisões com a LAPI automaticamente; este painel é somente leitura."

